//     std/float.dag | std/cardinality.dag (T-3 Wave-A3); D2a(2) rows co-
//     land when `GroundingMap` home is pinned.
//     SUBSTRATE SINGLE-AUTHORITY GUARD (mirror rust msg_2c2716dd):
//     python.dag MUST NOT mint std/ Int / UInt / Float / Nat / text
//     carriers locally; alias-identity to the existing std/ source is
