//     ambient; this line is **traceability only** per T-4 mgr brief.
//   - std/integer.dag | std/float.dag — **not consumed yet** (ladder T-3
//     Wave-A3); named owners for deferred `PythonInt` / bounded aliases.
//   DELETION PROVENANCE (D2 reshape, PR #3180): `IrToPython<>`, seven
